							<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1384269977016_428499_3101' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A &lt;i&gt;WireGroupingSpecification&lt;/i&gt; is used to describe a certain grouping requirements (e.g. twisted pair) in a certain context of usage (e.g. in the context of a 150% harness description). For this, a &lt;i&gt;WireGroupingSpecification&lt;/i&gt; is a container for various &lt;i&gt;WireGroupings&lt;/i&gt;. Each &lt;i&gt;WireGrouping&lt;/i&gt; is intended to reference the relevant W&lt;i&gt;ireElements&lt;/i&gt; that are grouped within an assembly / module / harness context as well as a &lt;i&gt;WireGroupSpecification&lt;/i&gt; in order to specify details regarding the way of grouping.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
								<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_201339C6_DC13_4f8c_90C5_8671A43C82BB'/>
							</ownedComment>
						</ownedDiagram>
					</modelExtension>
