				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_B5E1D4FC_8AC0_4434_A9F3_06ECD0D6373D' name='ModuleList'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_B5E1D4FC_8AC0_4434_A9F3_06ECD0D6373DDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A ModuleList is a mechanism to control additional / completition PartOccurrences. This means for a car configuration, if at least one of the modules in the list participates in the configuration, the &amp;quot;completitionComponent&amp;quot; participates, too.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_B5E1D4FC_8AC0_4434_A9F3_06ECD0D6373D'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_C7AABEF5_3AAF_4d0f_BF7C_797B867FC2F2' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_09572DFE_6FB1_4128_9EEB_B5F9028BF909' name='identification' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_09572DFE_6FB1_4128_9EEB_B5F9028BF909Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a unique identification of the ModuleList. The identification is guaranteed to be unique within the ModuleListSpecification. Over all VEC-documents a ModuleList-instance can be trusted to be the same if the ModuleListSpecification-instance is the same and the identification of the ModuleList is the same.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_09572DFE_6FB1_4128_9EEB_B5F9028BF909'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001263_6FB1_4128_9EEB_B5F9028BF909'/>
