						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1385739622566_133061_3132' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_71EA4408_1F82_434c_B15C_B85E191B99B7' name='Project'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_71EA4408_1F82_434c_B15C_B85E191B99B7Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a certain development project. Instances of this class are assumed to be constant. Thus this is located directly under VEC-root element.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_71EA4408_1F82_434c_B15C_B85E191B99B7'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_D4095731_648E_4022_8B01_DE47D1229A8A' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_2944CCEA_9F8A_46e2_8009_682F7A1D5430' name='carClassificationLevel2' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_2944CCEA_9F8A_46e2_8009_682F7A1D5430Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Provides a classification according to &amp;quot;CC8 Recommended Practices Specification and Configuration, Product Structures&amp;quot;. Car classification is the identification of a set of similar cars to be offered to the market. Level 2 stands for &amp;quot;Technical information / platform&amp;quot; and reflects the level of a product class in a BoM system which represents a main technical product base (e.g. project, platform, engineering series etc.). In some cases this level carries a complete BoM (&amp;quot;Maximum BoM&amp;quot;) for a project, platform, engineering series etc. This level is in some cases called technical documentation.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_2944CCEA_9F8A_46e2_8009_682F7A1D5430'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001589_9F8A_46e2_8009_682F7A1D5430'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001590_9F8A_46e2_8009_682F7A1D5430' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_60C3BDA4_AFD8_45d6_9C23_A9E230E8B7CC' name='carClassificationLevel3' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_60C3BDA4_AFD8_45d6_9C23_A9E230E8B7CCDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Provides a classification according to &amp;quot;CC8 Recommended Practices Specification and Configuration, Product Structures&amp;quot;. Car classification is the identification of a set of similar cars to be offered to the market. Level 3 stands for &amp;quot;Configuration information / product family&amp;quot; where all variant control mechanism are attached.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_60C3BDA4_AFD8_45d6_9C23_A9E230E8B7CC'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001591_AFD8_45d6_9C23_A9E230E8B7CC'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001592_AFD8_45d6_9C23_A9E230E8B7CC' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_E5E24A8E_55D9_49a0_B15D_5723A398DA2B' name='carClassificationLevel4' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_E5E24A8E_55D9_49a0_B15D_5723A398DA2BDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Provides a classification according to &amp;quot;CC8 Recommended Practices Specification and Configuration, Product Structures&amp;quot;. Car classification is the identification of a set of similar cars to be offered to the market. Level 4 stands for &amp;quot;Furthest pre-configured abstract product class&amp;quot; and represents the furthest configured class of a product, which is not yet a real product. E.g. this could be a complete vehicle, engine, gear-box etc. which has not been evaluated against customer special choices or an abstract vehicle, engine, gear-box etc. which could become a real one after the associated BoM is evaluated. The purpose of this level of a product class instance is in any case to reflect that level of product class of a BoM system which leads to the individual BoM for a single product.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_E5E24A8E_55D9_49a0_B15D_5723A398DA2B'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001593_55D9_49a0_B15D_5723A398DA2B'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001594_55D9_49a0_B15D_5723A398DA2B' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_0C9AFE6C_00CA_4910_82E5_AC0FC161B487' name='identification' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_0C9AFE6C_00CA_4910_82E5_AC0FC161B487Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the development order number (car or engine project)&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_0C9AFE6C_00CA_4910_82E5_AC0FC161B487'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001595_00CA_4910_82E5_AC0FC161B487'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001596_00CA_4910_82E5_AC0FC161B487' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_3591F6FD_5C67_4ed4_9D12_2CB1A7D4EFF3' name='description' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382703731024_96357_2253'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_3591F6FD_5C67_4ed4_9D12_2CB1A7D4EFF3Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Room for additional information about the item.&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_3591F6FD_5C67_4ed4_9D12_2CB1A7D4EFF3'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001597_5C67_4ed4_9D12_2CB1A7D4EFF3'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI001598_5C67_4ed4_9D12_2CB1A7D4EFF3' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_21C49408_5FE1_4551_BCDA_6169F299353D'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dstC49408_5FE1_4551_BCDA_6169F299353D'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_srcC49408_5FE1_4551_BCDA_6169F299353D'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_21C49408_5FE1_4551_BCDA_6169F299353DDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the &lt;i&gt;Projects&lt;/i&gt; in which the &lt;i&gt;UsageNode&lt;/i&gt; can be used.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_21C49408_5FE1_4551_BCDA_6169F299353D'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_srcC49408_5FE1_4551_BCDA_6169F299353D' visibility='public' type='EAID_A00422A0_ACAB_4468_88D8_19D6AAF1275D' association='EAID_21C49408_5FE1_4551_BCDA_6169F299353D'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001599__5FE1_4551_BCDA_6169F299353D'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI001600__5FE1_4551_BCDA_6169F299353D' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_F763B403_3A77_434c_8503_5819501E23FA'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst63B403_3A77_434c_8503_5819501E23FA'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src63B403_3A77_434c_8503_5819501E23FA'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_F763B403_3A77_434c_8503_5819501E23FADocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;References the &lt;i&gt;Projects&lt;/i&gt; to which the &lt;i&gt;UsageConstraint&lt;/i&gt; applies. This means the described PartVersion is allowed / denied in the referenced UsageConstraint.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_F763B403_3A77_434c_8503_5819501E23FA'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src63B403_3A77_434c_8503_5819501E23FA' visibility='public' type='EAID_CECC8E6A_EEB3_4e8f_8C45_34091C73060C' association='EAID_F763B403_3A77_434c_8503_5819501E23FA'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001603__3A77_434c_8503_5819501E23FA'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI001604__3A77_434c_8503_5819501E23FA' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Enumeration' xmi:id='EAID_30559659_C213_47f6_8220_2A0C7F9B4F9F' name='StatusOfApproval'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_30559659_C213_47f6_8220_2A0C7F9B4F9FDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enumeration for the definition of the state of an approval.&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_30559659_C213_47f6_8220_2A0C7F9B4F9F'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_C9930C7A_CD48_444e_B7EE_192A19E7218D' name='NotYetApproved'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_FF5931EC_F279_44b8_A231_FC6BBCCFD6F7' name='Approved'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_24C1A35B_1132_4be5_9C5A_B42947636028' name='Withdrawn'/>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Enumeration' xmi:id='EAID_5F2EA05A_F508_4c40_B579_D6C9E42D676F' name='TypeOfPermission'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_5F2EA05A_F508_4c40_B579_D6C9E42D676FDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enumeration for the definition of the type of a permission.&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_5F2EA05A_F508_4c40_B579_D6C9E42D676F'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_4B87ABBB_BF90_41ac_A897_E1859120EB0E' name='Seen'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_FBC82AF0_7735_45b4_91EB_8D4DD1ADF15E' name='Checked'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_3BABBE04_DE86_4087_8CA7_B60C75B75A3F' name='Released'/>
				</packagedElement>
			</packagedElement>
			<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Package' xmi:id='EAPK_C16A1157_6D96_4a36_BFCC_3EF5DB4B7C70' name='physical_information'>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_50477DF7_959E_4430_BD76_197E0E8BD541' name='AbrasionResistanceClass'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_50477DF7_959E_4430_BD76_197E0E8BD541Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Allows the definition of an abrasion resistance class. The abrasion resistance class of a component is specified as a level of resistance against abrasion. The level is specified by the ClassKey. Valid keys are specified by the reference system.&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Attributes of the type AbrasionResistanceClass normally have the multiplicity [0..*]. This means that such an attribute can have AbrasionResistanceClass entries for different ReferenceSystems. It must not have multiple entries for the same reference system.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_50477DF7_959E_4430_BD76_197E0E8BD541'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_28C0C81B_B3A8_4b86_9EDB_1BDEDA38649F' name='classKey' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_28C0C81B_B3A8_4b86_9EDB_1BDEDA38649FDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a key for the level defined in the abrasion resistance class (e.g. A, B, C).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_28C0C81B_B3A8_4b86_9EDB_1BDEDA38649F'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001607_B3A8_4b86_9EDB_1BDEDA38649F' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001608_B3A8_4b86_9EDB_1BDEDA38649F' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_33DCDBA8_CE60_4893_878D_C3661F3CFF3C' name='referenceSystem' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_33DCDBA8_CE60_4893_878D_C3661F3CFF3CDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The identification of the abrasion resistance class reference system, which is defining possible values and the semantic of abrasion resistance keys.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_33DCDBA8_CE60_4893_878D_C3661F3CFF3C'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001609_CE60_4893_878D_C3661F3CFF3C' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001610_CE60_4893_878D_C3661F3CFF3C' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_21218238_B9C5_4c0d_9C0B_9FD8562E8CB4' name='Color'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_21218238_B9C5_4c0d_9C0B_9FD8562E8CB4Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a color value. A color is always defined by a key value. What color is meant by this key value is defined by a standard reference systems (e.g. RAL).&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;For example if a RAL color should be expressed in the terms of the VEC the &lt;i&gt;referenceSystem&lt;/i&gt; would be &amp;quot;RAL&amp;quot;, the &lt;i&gt;key&lt;/i&gt; would be the RAL number defined by the standard (e.g. &amp;quot;1003&amp;quot; for signal yellow).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_21218238_B9C5_4c0d_9C0B_9FD8562E8CB4'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_85BB1931_D790_4330_8D68_1A8ED85D133C' name='key' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_85BB1931_D790_4330_8D68_1A8ED85D133CDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;The key of the color in the corresponding color reference system.&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_85BB1931_D790_4330_8D68_1A8ED85D133C'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001611_D790_4330_8D68_1A8ED85D133C' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001612_D790_4330_8D68_1A8ED85D133C' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_5FCC2AAD_C1BD_44c3_B8BE_E7E9562C011D' name='referenceSystem' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_5FCC2AAD_C1BD_44c3_B8BE_E7E9562C011DDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The identification of the color reference system, which is defining possible values and the semantic of color keys. (see KBLFRM-315)&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_5FCC2AAD_C1BD_44c3_B8BE_E7E9562C011D'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001613_C1BD_44c3_B8BE_E7E9562C011D' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001614_C1BD_44c3_B8BE_E7E9562C011D' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_75ADDEC5_49CF_40bb_8009_384B0553D49D' name='description' visibility='public' type='EAID_6E33CD1B_63D7_4da8_BED4_828037944989'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_75ADDEC5_49CF_40bb_8009_384B0553D49DDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;On optional human readable description of the color (e.g. the name). &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_75ADDEC5_49CF_40bb_8009_384B0553D49D'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001615_49CF_40bb_8009_384B0553D49D'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI001616_49CF_40bb_8009_384B0553D49D' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_9943BE34_78C6_4496_8AD3_E6130A81286D' name='CompositeUnit'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_9943BE34_78C6_4496_8AD3_E6130A81286DDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines a unit as a composition of other units. The composition is done by multiplying the different other units. By this way combined units like kg/m can be formed.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_9943BE34_78C6_4496_8AD3_E6130A81286D'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_6B43D3C6_72DC_4129_8BF9_137055275335' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_E9E6E5D1_05CC_427c_9FD0_4C45AAAA1066'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst3A3E5A_C15A_46bb_8069_474EA5358A43' name='factors' visibility='public' type='EAID_E9E6E5D1_05CC_427c_9FD0_4C45AAAA1066' association='EAID_DD3A3E5A_C15A_46bb_8069_474EA5358A43'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001617__C15A_46bb_8069_474EA5358A43' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI001618__C15A_46bb_8069_474EA5358A43' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_DD3A3E5A_C15A_46bb_8069_474EA5358A43'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst3A3E5A_C15A_46bb_8069_474EA5358A43'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src3A3E5A_C15A_46bb_8069_474EA5358A43'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_DD3A3E5A_C15A_46bb_8069_474EA5358A43Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;References the &lt;i&gt;Units&lt;/i&gt; that are used as factors to create the &lt;i&gt;CompositeUnit.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_DD3A3E5A_C15A_46bb_8069_474EA5358A43'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src3A3E5A_C15A_46bb_8069_474EA5358A43' visibility='public' type='EAID_9943BE34_78C6_4496_8AD3_E6130A81286D' association='EAID_DD3A3E5A_C15A_46bb_8069_474EA5358A43'/>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_D1B16792_0150_412a_AB28_4BF6BC34F362' name='CustomUnit'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_D1B16792_0150_412a_AB28_4BF6BC34F362Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;A CustomUnit can be used to define &quot;FreeText&quot;-Units. Custom units must not be used for units that can be expressed by any of the other subclasses of Unit. Custom units are only allowed if a unit  is needed that cannot be handled by any of the other classes. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_D1B16792_0150_412a_AB28_4BF6BC34F362'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_C2EA80D7_7E68_4a20_A12A_8481DB90C08E' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_E9E6E5D1_05CC_427c_9FD0_4C45AAAA1066'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_CD361542_EC97_40b8_AE23_B296A1799A90' name='identification' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_CD361542_EC97_40b8_AE23_B296A1799A90Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;A unique identification of the custom unit. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_CD361542_EC97_40b8_AE23_B296A1799A90'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001619_EC97_40b8_AE23_B296A1799A90' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001620_EC97_40b8_AE23_B296A1799A90' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Enumeration' xmi:id='EAID_C4EFA7D5_E529_4634_8D25_5E0DA33F183A' name='IECPrefix'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_C4EFA7D5_E529_4634_8D25_5E0DA33F183ADocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Enumeration for the definition of IEC unit prefixes.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_C4EFA7D5_E529_4634_8D25_5E0DA33F183A'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_3BC9FA20_A959_449a_9024_64CB447804F5' name='Yobi'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_75E3F422_5878_4183_8D9E_E20B2B253CF8' name='Zebi'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_C4A794F2_65AC_4fd6_BDB1_F13F25E18DD6' name='Exbi'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_D741027B_B227_4338_B8AE_97136108F1DA' name='Pebi'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_3A01FC4A_3773_4d63_BAA0_127D363CC09F' name='Tebi'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_6B47742F_846A_4ac8_9025_AE137C483B9E' name='Gibi'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_3E7C0255_8C0A_470f_A9E0_5CE477860793' name='Mebi'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_D83568FE_8DC9_469d_AE9B_7E63AAF85963' name='Kibi'/>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_2078A6EB_A8F1_4180_8FA0_34C0C3C37BF3' name='IECUnit'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_2078A6EB_A8F1_4180_8FA0_34C0C3C37BF3Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The IECUnit class can define quantities in the terms of the IEC-Unit-System by specifying the corresponding IEC prefix (optional) and an IEC unit name.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_2078A6EB_A8F1_4180_8FA0_34C0C3C37BF3'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_6C64D82F_E57D_4baf_8F01_A2573A3EF4E7' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_E9E6E5D1_05CC_427c_9FD0_4C45AAAA1066'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_239552A0_32BA_4ffe_B5C1_825E4F69ECE4' name='iecUnitName' visibility='public' type='EAID_D53A8856_31AA_404e_A0C2_D17EAAF5BEA9'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1385545556307_884869_2707' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the name of the IEC unit.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_239552A0_32BA_4ffe_B5C1_825E4F69ECE4'/>
						</ownedComment>
