				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_3743B0EB_6605_4676_AEF6_0B3BA250DA91' name='SoundDampingClass'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_3743B0EB_6605_4676_AEF6_0B3BA250DA91Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Allows the definition of a sound damping class. The sound damping class of a component is specified as a level of sound damping. The level is specified by the &lt;i&gt;classKey&lt;/i&gt;. Valid keys are specified by the &lt;i&gt;referenceSystem&lt;/i&gt;. Attributes of the type &lt;i&gt;SoundDampingClass&lt;/i&gt; normally have the multiplicity [0..*]. This means that such an attribute can have &lt;i&gt;SoundDampingClass&lt;/i&gt; entries for different &lt;i&gt;referenceSystems&lt;/i&gt;. It must not have multiple entries for the same &lt;i&gt;referenceSystem&lt;/i&gt;.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_3743B0EB_6605_4676_AEF6_0B3BA250DA91'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_6BDA74B9_B2C2_4e76_992B_34707E0CFC1F' name='classKey' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_6BDA74B9_B2C2_4e76_992B_34707E0CFC1FDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a key for the level defined in the sound damping class (e.g. A, B, C).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_6BDA74B9_B2C2_4e76_992B_34707E0CFC1F'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001671_B2C2_4e76_992B_34707E0CFC1F' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001672_B2C2_4e76_992B_34707E0CFC1F' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_F5B0BF37_C3D1_4971_A777_8B167DFCC692' name='referenceSystem' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_F5B0BF37_C3D1_4971_A777_8B167DFCC692Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The identification of the sound damping class reference system, which is defining possible values and the semantic of sound damping keys.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_F5B0BF37_C3D1_4971_A777_8B167DFCC692'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001673_C3D1_4971_A777_8B167DFCC692' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001674_C3D1_4971_A777_8B167DFCC692' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_4F6487F1_26BD_4c01_9D1B_0657A585F66C' name='TemperatureInformation'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_4F6487F1_26BD_4c01_9D1B_0657A585F66CDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the temperature information for a general technical part. It is necessary to define this in an external class and not as an attribute, since a part can have multiple different temperature information e.g. operating temperature, storage temperature, processing temperature, environment temperature. An additional constraint is that one GeneralTechnicalPartSpecification can own multiple TemperatureInformations, but must not have more than one TemperatureInformations of the same temperatureType.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_4F6487F1_26BD_4c01_9D1B_0657A585F66C'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_FA3F6536_2F73_40ad_B066_36676ADB79A1' name='temperatureRange' visibility='public' type='EAID_CAF23CB7_00D0_48de_9B42_ADB340B9B4A8'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_FA3F6536_2F73_40ad_B066_36676ADB79A1Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the allowed temperature range for this type of temperature. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_FA3F6536_2F73_40ad_B066_36676ADB79A1'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001675_2F73_40ad_B066_36676ADB79A1'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001676_2F73_40ad_B066_36676ADB79A1' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_9F064B84_0D1A_43b8_9983_5CC28E0557D8' name='temperatureType' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_9F064B84_0D1A_43b8_9983_5CC28E0557D8Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;The type of a TemperatureInformation. This should be an enumeration of values defined in a conformance class. Possible values are: EnvironmentTemperature, OperationTemperature, StorageTemperature, ProcessingTemperature.&#10;(see KBLFRM-311)&#10;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_9F064B84_0D1A_43b8_9983_5CC28E0557D8'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001677_0D1A_43b8_9983_5CC28E0557D8'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001678_0D1A_43b8_9983_5CC28E0557D8' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_7457DD90_7E8E_4045_9E17_882CA3FA1A36' name='Tolerance'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_7457DD90_7E8E_4045_9E17_882CA3FA1A36Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enables the specification of value ranges which can be tolerated.&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_7457DD90_7E8E_4045_9E17_882CA3FA1A36'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_77D3EB99_E490_4d5e_B4BC_ED66833EB34A' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_EB693EC7_FA16_4038_A826_0743F2A6DD21' name='lowerBoundary' visibility='public' type='EAJava_double'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_EB693EC7_FA16_4038_A826_0743F2A6DD21Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the lower boundary for the tolerance.&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_EB693EC7_FA16_4038_A826_0743F2A6DD21'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001679_FA16_4038_A826_0743F2A6DD21' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001680_FA16_4038_A826_0743F2A6DD21' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
