					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_866D71D9_7A65_4621_8FA4_0843D874EFC5Documentation' body='Specifies the UsageConstraints that apply to the PartVersion or PartUsages described by the UsageConstraintSpecification. &#10;'>
